<title>POLAND: Rafako wins PLN 100 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Rafako wins PLN 100 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial boilermaker Rafako SA won a contract worth over 100 million zlotys to make a desulphurisation installation in the  Elektrownia Siersza SA power plant, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details and no company officials were immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
